<chapter id="credits">
<title>Credits and Licence</title>

<para>&pdfsmithy;</para>

<para>Program copyright 2026 Tom Bueng
<email>tombueng@gmail.com</email></para>

<para>Documentation copyright 2026 Tom Bueng
<email>tombueng@gmail.com</email></para>

<para>&pdfsmithy; stands on other people's work. QPDF does the structural
manipulation that makes lossless editing possible, Poppler renders the pages
and extracts their text, Tesseract recognises the text on scans and Leptonica
cleans up the images it is given, and Ghostscript, run as a separate program
and never linked, does the image compression and the PDF/A conversion. It is
built on &Qt; and &kf6-full;.</para>

